    {
      "_id": "whbUrsBloodSnt01",
      "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp",
      "name": "血腥嗅觉",
      "sort": 500000,
      "type": "action",
      "system": {
        "actionType": { "value": "passive" },
        "actions": { "value": null },
        "category": "interaction",
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>死神熊能嗅到鲜血。对正在受到<strong>持续流血</strong>的生物：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>在 <strong>60 尺</strong>内拥有<strong>不精确</strong>感知；</li>\n<li>在 <strong>30 尺</strong>内可直接锁定打击（无视隐蔽所需的 DC 5 持平检定）；</li>\n<li>对其打击获得 +1 环境加值。</li>\n</ul>"
        },
        "publication": {
          "title": "猎杀对决 — 怪物",
