    {
      "_id": "whbUrsPursue0001",
      "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp",
      "name": "血腥追猎",
      "sort": 510000,
      "type": "action",
      "system": {
        "actionType": { "value": "passive" },
        "actions": { "value": null },
        "category": "offensive",
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>当死神熊受到某个生物的伤害时，它会将该生物记为<strong>猎物</strong>（同时只保留最近一个）。只要猎物在 120 尺内，死神熊在自己回合必须以至少一次 Stride / Climb 朝猎物靠近（无法靠近时改为朝最近听到的方向），并优先对猎物发动打击。</p>\n<p>若猎物带有持续流血，死神熊在朝其 Stride 时速度视为 +10 尺。</p>"
        },
        "publication": {
          "title": "猎杀对决 — 怪物",
          "authors": "Wang Homebrew / Hunt: Showdown",
          "license": "ORC",
          "remaster": true
        },
        "rules": [],
        "slug": null,
        "traits": { "value": [] }
      }
    },
    {
      "_id": "whbUrsRake000001",
      "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/TwoActions.webp",
      "name": "四臂撕扯",
      "sort": 600000,
      "type": "action",
      "system": {
        "actionType": { "value": "action" },
        "actions": { "value": 2 },
        "category": "offensive",
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>以两只利爪对同一目标各发动一次打击（第二次受多重攻击罚值）。两次皆命中时，额外造成 @Damage[1d6[persistent,bleed]]（与爪击流血合并取高，不叠加骰数）。</p>"
        },
        "publication": {
          "title": "猎杀对决 — 怪物",
